{"name":"问道长生_V0.8_机制版","entries":{"0":{"uid":0,"key":["问道长生","修仙世界","东洲","修仙"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【常驻】世界定位与知识参考","content":"《问道长生》是一个残酷的修仙世界，主角并非龙傲天，这世界也不只有主角一人，同时也是丰富多彩的修仙世界，它有自己的世界线，并不是围绕主角一个人转。\n\n本世界已经明确规定的规则与事实必须优先遵守。\n\n严格区分：\n已经确认的世界事实；\n角色已经知道的信息；\n角色自己的猜测；\nNPC已经知道的信息；\nNPC自己的猜测；\n尚未发现的信息。\n\n猜测不能自动成为事实。\n角色只能根据自身实际拥有的信息进行判断。\n【时间格式】\n年份用阿拉伯数字（342年），禁止\"三百四十二年\"。\n月份和日期用阿拉伯数字（5月12日）。\n时间用 24 小时制（14:30）或时段（清晨/上午/中午/下午/傍晚/夜晚/深夜）。\n禁止使用\"午时/子时/卯时/申时\"等传统时辰。\n时间会自然流逝世界会有自己的时间线，不应该围绕主角一个人转。\n示例：time:342年5月12日 14:30\n\n对于世界书没有明确规定的普通内容，可以参考常见修仙、仙侠世界的通用知识进行合理推导。\n\n允许AI自然生成符合修仙世界逻辑的：\n人物、地点、势力、物品、材料、丹药、法器、任务、价格、社会关系、生活细节、传闻、宗门日常以及其他普通世界内容。\n\n其他作品独有的人物、势力、历史、特殊机制和世界观，不得直接视为《问道长生》的既定事实。\n\n新生成且已经在游戏中实际确认的内容，之后视为当前世界事实并保持连续。\n\n如果已经存在明确的本世界规则，则不得使用通用修仙常识覆盖本世界规则。\n\n","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":100,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":0,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[]},"1":{"uid":1,"key":["境界","炼气","筑基","结晶","金丹","具灵","元婴","化神","悟道","羽化","登仙"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】修仙境界","content":"修仙境界依次为：炼气、筑基、结晶、金丹、具灵、元婴、化神、悟道、羽化、登仙。每个大境界分为初期、中期、后期、圆满。必须完成当前境界的修为积累后，才能尝试突破下一境界。登仙之后不再属于普通境界提升，而涉及飞升与超脱。各境界修为上限、灵力上限、气血上限、神识上限由系统面板显示。AI 在正文中不给出具体数字。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":99,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":1,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"2":{"uid":2,"key":["寿元","寿命"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】境界寿元","content":"各境界基础寿元上限：炼气100、筑基200、结晶300、金丹500、具灵800、元婴1200、化神2000、悟道5000、羽化10000、登仙50000。角色年龄和寿元属于持续状态数据，时间经过会正常影响寿元。可通过丹药机缘等永久增加","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":98,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":2,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"3":{"uid":3,"key":["灵气","天地灵气","修炼","吐纳","引气入体"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】灵气与修炼基础","content":"天地灵气是修仙世界的基础能量。修士通过功法吸收、炼化天地灵气进行修炼。灵气浓度会受到环境、灵地、资源以及特殊区域等因素影响。正常修炼方式包括日常吐纳、闭关、丹药辅助、灵地修炼、双修、传功、奇遇、突破反哺、战斗感悟和顿悟。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":97,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":3,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"4":{"uid":4,"key":["修为","修为值"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】修为","content":"修为代表修士当前境界中的积累。修为达到当前境界要求后，才具备尝试突破下一境界的基础。修为与灵力是两个独立概念。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":96,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":4,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"5":{"uid":5,"key":["灵力","灵力值","法术","术法"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】灵力","content":"灵力代表修士当前能够实际调用的力量，用于施展术法、使用法器以及其他需要消耗力量的能力。灵力与修为独立。修为增长不等于灵力同步增加，灵力消耗也不代表修为下降。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":95,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":5,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"6":{"uid":6,"key":["灵根","伪灵根","真灵根","地灵根","天灵根","变异灵根","无界灵根"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】灵根","content":"灵根影响修炼速度以及功法适配。正常灵根体系包括伪灵根、真灵根、地灵根、天灵根、变异灵根。无界灵根属于本世界特殊隐藏设定，不属于普通公开知识。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":94,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":6,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"7":{"uid":7,"key":["道基","筑基","道基裂痕"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】道基","content":"筑基之后形成道基。道基会影响后续修炼与突破。突破失败可能造成道基裂痕。道基裂痕属于真实持续状态，需要根据实际情况处理，不得无故消失。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":93,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":7,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"8":{"uid":8,"key":["道印","天道筑基"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】道印","content":"道印属于通过天道筑基获得的特殊存在。具体表现以已经确认的角色状态和实际世界事实为准。","constant":false,"selective":true,"order":92,"position":4,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":true,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":0,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":1,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":0,"displayIndex":8,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"9":{"uid":9,"key":["资质","悟性","身灵","道心","仙缘","五维","属性"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】五维属性","content":"角色拥有资质、悟性、身灵、道心、仙缘五项基础属性，范围为1至100，基础上限为100，到达100后有特殊加成。资质主要影响修炼潜力，悟性影响理解与领悟，身灵影响身体与修炼相关表现，道心影响心境与心魔应对，仙缘影响机缘与运势。普通日常生活不会无理由提升属性。重大突破、机缘、试炼、传承或宝物等特殊情况可以产生永久变化。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":92,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":9,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"10":{"uid":10,"key":["神识","神识修为","神念","探查","神识探查"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】神识体系","content":"神识独立于普通修为成长，拥有独立的段位与神识修为。神念是神识实际可调用的资源。神识可以用于感知、探查、御物、识破幻术、战斗以及其他符合当前能力的行为。神识段位依次为：蒙昧、清明、出窍、照幽、通神、大观。神念会因使用而消耗，并可以自然恢复或通过修炼、丹药等方式恢复。神识段位与修为境界完全独立。修为高的人神识可能很低，修为低的人神识可能很高。神识功法可提升神识修炼速度，加成系数与功法品阶一致。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":90,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":10,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"11":{"uid":11,"key":["功法","功法品阶","黄阶","玄阶","地阶","天阶","仙阶"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】功法","content":"功法品阶为：黄、玄、地、天、仙。功法可以包括主修功法、攻击术法、身法、炼体功法、神识功法、秘术等。功法拥有熟练度上限100。长期修炼和实际使用可以提升熟练度。高熟练度可以进一步形成特殊效果或功法领域。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":89,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":11,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[]},"12":{"uid":12,"key":["六艺","炼丹","炼器","符箓","阵法","御兽","灵植"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【核心数据】六艺","content":"六艺为炼丹、炼器、符箓、阵法、御兽、灵植。六艺彼此独立成长，统一阶段为学徒、一品、二品、三品、四品、五品、六品。\n\n熟练度从 0 开始连续累积，不清零。\n\n各品阶对应熟练度区间：\n学徒 0~20\n一品 20~100\n二品 100~500\n三品 500~3000\n四品 3000~8000\n五品 8000~30000\n六品 30000~100000\n\n示例：学徒（20/20）→ 一品（20/100）→ 二品（100/500）→ 三品（548/3000）\n\n部分高阶段可能额外需要师承、传承、声望、突破或重大机缘。\n\n炼丹、炼器、符箓、御兽存在成功与失败；阵法、灵植通常不采用普通制作成功率判定。\n\n炼丹另有丹道·天成 → 丹道·化境 → 丹道·无极三个更高层次，无极为最高，无人成，无记载，随手成丹。\n\n六艺品阶与熟练度由系统面板显示。","constant":true,"selective":true,"order":88,"position":0,"disable":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"probability":100,"useProbability":true,"depth":4,"group":"","groupOverride":false,"groupWeight":100,"scanDepth":0,"caseSensitive":false,"matchWholeWords":false,"useGroupScoring":false,"automationId":"","role":null,"displayIndex":12,"vectorized":false,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"ignoreBudget":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":false,"outletName":"","sticky":0,"cooldown":0,"delay":0,"triggers":[],"characterFilter":{"isExclude":false,"names":[],"tags":[]}},"13":{"uid":13,"key":["NPC","弟子","修士","凡人","资质","灵根","体质","血脉","天赋","悟性","招收","收徒","测灵","资质测试"],"keysecondary":[],"comment":"【角色资质生成】","content":"除主角外，NPC、弟子、修士、凡人等角色同样可以拥有不同的灵根、体质、血脉、天赋、悟性和其他资质。\n\n具体类型、稀有程度和实际表现，根据角色的出身、经历、环境、机缘及当前设定自然形成。","constant":true,"vectorized":false,"selective":true,"selectiveLogic":0,"addMemo":true,"order":91,"position":0,"disable":false,"ignoreBudget":false,"excludeRecursion":false,"preventRecursion":false,"matchPersonaDescription":false,"matchCharacterDescription":false,"matchCharacterPersonality":false,"matchCharacterDepthPrompt":false,"matchScenario":false,"matchCreatorNotes":false,"delayUntilRecursion":fals